<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Orix says 12-mth net up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Lanka Orix says 12-mth net up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			   1997		   1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	  721.13    vs	643.80</p>
<p>    Net profit	163.58    vs	123.26</p>
<p>    Tax		   4.80    vs	  6.11</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Lanka Orix Leasing is Sri Lanka's main dedicated leasing firm.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
